    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793260/extras/b25974728261a8def70fcc48b9550a4c.poster.avif?t=1754054896\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793260/extras/b25974728261a8def70fcc48b9550a4c.webm?t=1754054896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Delivery INC puts you in control of operating a delivery company. Your goal is to pick up passengers, packages and food, then deliver them before the customer\u2019s patience runs out. Make quick decisions and test your logic as you manage multiple deliveries at once. Which driver will pick up the next delivery? Should they pick up or drop off other deliveries on the way? String together the best plan and route while making sure you don\u2019t leave your customers waiting too long.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793260/extras/7705bbf78d7b18361093a6559918027c.poster.avif?t=1754054896\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793260/extras/7705bbf78d7b18361093a6559918027c.webm?t=1754054896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793260/extras/7705bbf78d7b18361093a6559918027c.mp4?t=1754054896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Your delivery drivers will occasionally find themselves facing difficult challenges causing them to reach out to you for helpful advice. Make your choices wisely to avoid disaster and turn the situation into something positive. Take chances, explore multiple outcomes, and expect the unexpected with random elements that keep things fresh.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793260/extras/4829aa91f9bc907bf3609248a76c6b21.poster.avif?t=1754054896\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793260/extras/4829aa91f9bc907bf3609248a76c6b21.webm?t=1754054896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Start your company in any city, anywhere in the world. Test your skills on the most realistic roads and routes possible. Every city is created using real-world map data.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793260/extras/df8ab0e2bb711b75043919f7ec7c5dcd.poster.avif?t=1754054896\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793260/extras/df8ab0e2bb711b75043919f7ec7c5dcd.webm?t=1754054896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Your fleet of vehicles and drivers is a key part of running a successful company. Each driver has personality traits that can positively or negatively influence their performance. Every vehicle has advantages and disadvantages. Assemble a crew that best fits your company and playstyle.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793260/extras/4c161c8b3881e32ad8966c968ce7cdd0.poster.avif?t=1754054896\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793260/extras/4c161c8b3881e32ad8966c968ce7cdd0.webm?t=1754054896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Customer reviews can have a drastic impact on your company's reputation, so it\u2019s important to make sure each customer has the best possible experience. Having a high average rating will increase your number of customers and profits. A low average rating will leave you struggling to survive.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793260/extras/b25974728261a8def70fcc48b9550a4c.poster.avif?t=1754054896\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793260/extras/b25974728261a8def70fcc48b9550a4c.webm?t=1754054896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Delivery INC puts you in control of operating a delivery company. Your goal is to pick up passengers, packages and food, then deliver them before the customer\u2019s patience runs out. Make quick decisions and test your logic as you manage multiple deliveries at once. Which driver will pick up the next delivery? Should they pick up or drop off other deliveries on the way? String together the best plan and route while making sure you don\u2019t leave your customers waiting too long.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793260/extras/7705bbf78d7b18361093a6559918027c.poster.avif?t=1754054896\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793260/extras/7705bbf78d7b18361093a6559918027c.webm?t=1754054896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793260/extras/7705bbf78d7b18361093a6559918027c.mp4?t=1754054896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Your delivery drivers will occasionally find themselves facing difficult challenges causing them to reach out to you for helpful advice. Make your choices wisely to avoid disaster and turn the situation into something positive. Take chances, explore multiple outcomes, and expect the unexpected with random elements that keep things fresh.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop